1
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:21,450
I am an art student and I paint a lot of pictures.

2
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:26,320
Many people pretend that they understand modern art.

3
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:30,550
They always tell you what a picture is 'about'.

4
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:35,300
Of course, many pictures are not 'about' anything.

5
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,110
They are just pretty patterns.

6
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:44,180
We like them in the sa me way that we like pretty curtain material.

7
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:52,010
I think that young children often appreciate modern pictures better than anyone else.

8
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:54,270
They notice more.

9
00:00:54,270 --> 00:01:02,670
My sister is only seven, but she always tells me whether my pictures are good or not.

10
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:05,940
She came into my room yesterday.

11
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:08,170
'What are you doing?'

12
00:01:08,170 --> 00:01:09,360
she asked.

13
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:14,590
'I'm hanging this picture on the wall,' I answered.

14
00:01:14,590 --> 00:01:15,966
'It's a new one.

15
00:01:15,966 --> 00:01:17,480
Do you like it?'

16
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:21,070
She looked at it critically for a moment.

17
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:26,930
'It's all right,' she said, 'but isn't it upside down?'

18
00:01:26,930 --> 00:01:28,970
I looked at it again.

19
00:01:28,970 --> 00:01:33,020
She was right!

20
00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:34,861
It was!
